;    1: TDecorate(count=514, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=304, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=1485, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=1352, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―After I had finished the mountain seclusion, <STYLE ID="1">Ko-san</STYLE> said this to me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kikyo</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, is there anything you want? It's to celebrate finishing the mountain seclusion!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Something I want?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had only just finished the mountain seclusion, and perhaps because I had been cut off from the everyday world, I no longer had any desire for possessions.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just having warm meals and a futon was the greatest luxury there could be.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If there was anything I wanted beyond that―<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I'd like books."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Books?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes, for my studies."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Hahaha, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kikyo</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you really are eager to learn."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\鍵束.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\サード\鍵束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
So <STYLE ID="1">Ko-san</STYLE> entrusted me with a key.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was, he said, the key to the Niimura family's storehouse.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He said the storehouse held many books from long ago, and I could read them as I pleased.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Some had been written by Westerners who came here long ago, he said, so they were just right for learning about Western culture.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵明るい.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The only problem was whether I could read those books.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They were all old writings, and some were even written in foreign languages, I heard.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
These days, it seemed, no one even in the settlement could read them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He had given me this reward with the work of deciphering those books folded into it.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本棚真横.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Wow... So many...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Before my eyes were the storehouse's books, inscribed with several hundred years of history.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How much time would it take to read all of these?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What was more, they held things that almost no one in this country knew.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―At first, even reading a single sentence was hard.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no decent dictionary, and much of it was beyond anything my knowledge until then could handle.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, as time goes on, one gradually grows used to it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Before long I was able to read them to some extent.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And among them, there was a word that caught my attention.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, do you know about Droga?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Droga?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Yeah, I know it. It's a drug that enhances human strength."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was just as the books had said.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So this settlement did have a mysterious drug that enhanced human strength.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, have you ever used it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, I haven't. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It's supposed to be hard to use, so they won't let you use it until you're 20 or older."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Then some of the other residents have used it, haven't they?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, it gets used a lot. They say that when you use it for hunting and the like, it makes things really easy. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Actually, when I first came to Tokyo, what I tried to present to the Emperor was Droga."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see. So that's what lay behind it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But... the Emperor wouldn't accept it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I suppose it looked suspicious after all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Why did you try to present it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"My mother, the Grand Witch, had me do it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">In this age of contact with the Great Powers, she thought it was about time we researched Droga's effects too."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"In other words, the idea was that presenting Droga would interest the Emperor, and then funds and facilities for research could be obtained?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, that's it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But I failed... The Emperor asked me if there was something I wanted instead. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Refusing the gift and sending me home empty-handed on top of that would have been shameful for the Emperor. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So I took the plunge and asked if there was any woman who'd be willing to live in Arata."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"And so I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Thinking of it that way, it's strange somehow."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah. </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kikyo</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, when I think about how you came to me, it wasn't all bad. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">my mother told me something earlier, and..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I know. I'm to research Droga, aren't I?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Haha, you're as sharp as ever..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"After all, I was known as a clever woman! Now that I've come here, I'll give you all the help I can!"</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------